<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genzyme restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genzyme restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it restarted coverage of Genzyme Corp with near- and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 21-5/8 in early trade.</p>
</text>
